    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your beloved cat has been taken. In your desperate search, you uncover something far worse than you imagined, a paranoid streamer obsessed with esoteric experiments that disrupt electricity and WiFi. His lair is a maze of eerie tech, cryptic notes, and hidden horrors. And in the shadows, something watches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a determined woman who will stop at nothing to rescue her cat from the clutches of this unstable streamer. Navigate his chaotic world, decipher his twisted mind through discarded notes and dropped keys, and unlock the secrets of the garage where he hides his captives. But every step closer to the truth draws you nearer to <i>'it,'</i> a terrifying presence tied to his madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rescue your cat and uncover the truth, or will the darkness of his experiments consume you?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your beloved cat has been taken. In your desperate search, you uncover something far worse than you imagined, a paranoid streamer obsessed with esoteric experiments that disrupt electricity and WiFi. His lair is a maze of eerie tech, cryptic notes, and hidden horrors. And in the shadows, something watches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a determined woman who will stop at nothing to rescue her cat from the clutches of this unstable streamer. Navigate his chaotic world, decipher his twisted mind through discarded notes and dropped keys, and unlock the secrets of the garage where he hides his captives. But every step closer to the truth draws you nearer to <i>'it,'</i> a terrifying presence tied to his madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rescue your cat and uncover the truth, or will the darkness of his experiments consume you?</p>",
